<title>HONG KONG: BZW ups warrants on basket of China concept stocks.</title>
<headline>BZW ups warrants on basket of China concept stocks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Monday it has increased the issue size on the American-style call warrants on a basket of China concept stocks to 135 million warrants from 130 million warrants.</p>
<p>Terms of the warrants remain unchanged.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p>  CITIC Pacific Ltd			 0.1 shares</p>
<p>  Ng Fung Hong Ltd			  0.8 shares</p>
<p>  China Resources Enterprise Ltd	0.4 shares</p>
<p>  New World Development Co Ltd	  0.1 shares</p>
<p>  Guangzhou Investment Co Ltd	   1.2 shares</p>
<p>  Kumagai Gumi (Hong Kong) Ltd	  0.4 shares</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
